" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[906,57][1044,195]" /></node></node><node index="1" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.termlink.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="true" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[36,252][1044,1878]"><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.View" package="com.termlink.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[36,252][1044,1821]"><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="androidx.compose.ui.viewinterop.ViewFactoryHolder" package="com.termlink.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[222,0][1008,1785]"><node index="0" text="已修订，且没有把 `revision` 改名后继续保留。&#10;&#10;- 从公共 `BatchSourceRef`、架构 item schema、upsert 覆盖规则中移除 item/source `revision`。&#10;- Coordinator 不再“返回已有 revision”或“不增加 revision”，改为基于 durable receipt/canonical record 幂等处理。&#10;- 登记表明确：item/source `revision` 仅是旧 formal/阶段 4 实现残留，L2/L3 禁止；`wire_source_revision` 仅表示上游源码 provenance。&#10;- 代码未修改，旧 Node/Rust revision 路径登记为 `legacy-generated / migration-required`。&#10;&#10;涉及文件：&#10;&#10;- Data Contract&#10;- Architecture&#10;- Coordinator Contract&#10;- 概念状态登记表&#10;&#10;验证：`node --test tests/codexRolloutCollector.test.js` 30/30 通过，`git diff --check` 通过。&#10;&#10;仍有边界：`docs/workflow/CONTRACTS.md` 与 `DECISIONS.md` 当前任务禁止修改，其中 AD-011/AD-012 仍保留旧 formal `revision` 条款；本轮已明确它们不属于 4.5 公共接口依据。若要连治理文档一起清除，需要另行扩大范围。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.termlink.app" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="fa